  1: (function () {
  2:   'use strict';
  3: 
  4:   /*
  5:     DKG mobile main homepage collection plate controller - Step 7 cloned layer.
  6: 
  7:     Safer strategy:
  8:     - Do not move original product DOM.
  9:     - Mark original products/tracks hidden on mobile.
 10:     - Clone product cards into a separate mobile carousel viewport.
 11:     - Background and labels stay in their original DOM positions.
